        "id": "97876",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# ✨ Image Enhance\n\nA live photo editor. Each filter exposes numeric properties that a mini app binds to sliders, and the preview updates as you drag.\n\n**How it works:** \"Source photo\" ships with a photo of a coffee mug. \"Denoise (radius)\" is a Gaussian blur set to radius 0, so it is off by default. \"Brightness & contrast\" applies brightness 0.05 and contrast 1.15. \"Saturation & hue\" raises saturation to 1.2. \"Sharpen (amount)\" is an unsharp mask with amount 1 and threshold 0.02. \"Enhanced image\" shows the result. The chain runs on the GPU in the browser with no model, API key or per-run cost.\n\n**Try this:** Set \"radius\" on \"Denoise (radius)\" to 2 and \"amount\" on \"Sharpen (amount)\" to 2. Noise in flat areas softens while edges stay crisp."
        },
